1
00:04:46,000 --> 00:04:50,000
Variabel centrifugeringshastighed, fremragende tumblingsydelse ...

2
00:04:50,000 --> 00:04:54,000
... I en ... handy ... enhed. Skinnende ren.

3
00:04:57,000 --> 00:05:01,000
Nå, det her ... det må hellere være godt.

4
00:05:01,000 --> 00:05:04,000
Det tog mig aldre tid at binde det reb.

5
00:05:05,000 --> 00:05:07,000
Med mine forbandede hove.

6
00:05:07,000 --> 00:05:09,000
Ikke mere behov for hove.

7
00:05:09,000 --> 00:05:11,000
Ikke mere frække forretninger.

8
00:05:12,000 --> 00:05:14,500
Ho! Tiden flyver..

9
00:05:14,500 --> 00:05:16,700
Vent vent vent vent vent vent.

10
00:05:16,700 --> 00:05:18,500
Hvordan virker den her ting?

11
00:05:18,500 --> 00:05:21,000
Jeg mener, hvordan får jeg det til at fungere?

12
00:05:21,000 --> 00:05:22,500
Nej, det gør ikke.
